1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:04,950
A drill moved across the table can look very different in an image.
电钻换到桌面另一处，图像外观可能变化很大。

2
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:10,890
DP3 asks whether a compact three-dimensional observation makes that change easier to handle.
DP3问，紧凑三维观测能否更好应对变化？

3
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:15,350
It keeps diffusion action generation but changes what the policy sees.
它保留扩散动作生成，改变策略看到的表示。

4
00:00:15,803 --> 00:00:20,643
A calibrated depth camera produces points that are cropped to the robot workspace.
标定深度相机产生点，再裁剪到机器人工作空间。

5
00:00:21,203 --> 00:00:25,183
Sampling keeps a sparse set of coordinates rather than a dense colored reconstruction.
采样保留稀疏坐标，而非密集彩色重建。

6
00:00:25,783 --> 00:00:30,503
The representation emphasizes geometry while reducing dependence on surface appearance.
这种表示强调几何，减少对表面外观的依赖。

7
00:00:31,223 --> 00:00:36,203
A lightweight point encoder compresses that geometry into features for the policy.
轻量点编码器把几何压缩成策略特征。

8
00:00:36,823 --> 00:00:41,123
Robot state joins those features to condition a diffusion model of future actions.
机器人状态与特征共同作为未来动作扩散模型条件。

9
00:00:41,423 --> 00:00:45,483
Updated observations keep the action sequence connected to the changing scene.
更新观测让动作序列持续对应变化的场景。

10
00:00:45,958 --> 00:00:52,098
Real experiments combine a Franka arm, an Allegro hand, and an L515 camera.
真机实验使用Franka、Allegro和L515相机。

11
00:00:52,558 --> 00:00:57,078
Roll-up, dumpling making, and drilling use the hand; pouring uses a gripper.
卷起、包饺子和钻孔用手，倾倒使用夹爪。

12
00:00:57,498 --> 00:01:02,398
Each real task receives forty demonstrations, with ten evaluation trials per setting.
每项真机任务40条示教，每设置评测十次。

13
00:01:02,954 --> 00:01:10,034
Across all four tasks, DP3 averages eighty-five percent success versus thirty-five for RGB diffusion.
四任务平均，DP3为85%，RGB扩散为35%。

14
00:01:10,574 --> 00:01:15,294
That is a fifty-percentage-point gain inside this particular experimental protocol.
这是该实验协议内提升50个百分点。

15
00:01:15,874 --> 00:01:20,098
The table combines different end effectors, which matters when interpreting the average.
表格混合不同末端执行器，解释均值时要注意。

16
00:01:20,548 --> 00:01:26,208
For the three hand tasks alone, the reported DP3 scores are ninety, seventy, and eighty.
三项手任务中，DP3分别为90%、70%、80%。

17
00:01:26,748 --> 00:01:30,408
Their mean is eighty percent, computed from those three table entries.
三项均值为80%，由原表这三格计算。

18
00:01:30,908 --> 00:01:34,648
The gripper's perfect pouring result should not inflate a hand-only summary.
夹爪倾倒的满分不应抬高手任务的总结。

19
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:39,950
A single depth view still misses surfaces hidden behind the object or hand.
单路深度仍看不到物体或手后方的表面。

20
00:01:40,390 --> 00:01:44,550
Calibration errors also move the points relative to the robot's working coordinates.
标定误差也会让点偏离机器人工作坐标。

21
00:01:44,990 --> 00:01:50,170
Some generalization settings have very few trials, so reliability claims need restraint.
部分泛化设置试验很少，可靠性结论需要克制。

22
00:01:50,758 --> 00:01:56,778
DP3 demonstrates that useful geometric structure can improve learning from limited demonstrations.
DP3说明，有用几何结构能改善有限示教学习。

23
00:01:57,378 --> 00:02:02,198
It does not establish a new hand-tracking accuracy record or provide tactile feedback.
它没有刷新手追踪精度，也没有提供触觉反馈。

24
00:02:02,698 --> 00:02:07,478
Use its results to choose observations, then test the contacts your task requires.
用结果指导观测选择，再测试目标任务所需接触。
